      "category": "Text",
      "text": "THE RESERVE PAYS OFF! The 373rd Transportation Major Port and its affiliated units now have vacancies for all grades of former enlisted men and women of all branches of the service. Men and women who are interested in and want to actively serve in the Organized Reserve program are needed.",
