        "ink_px": 18409,
        "area_px": 304580,
        "density": 0.06044,
        "chars": 236,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.82
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        180,
        2677,
        1846,
        2922
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "We're at the Port every Monday night. Why not stop in and learn for yourself the advantages the 373rd offers to you. Or, come in at any time during the week, you'll find us on the 4th floor of Building \"A\" at the Army Base. If you can't visit with us soon, just call GEdward 9-5400, Ext. 303, and we'll give you the answers to any questions you may have.",
